# Build system
.env
# Per-system connection profiles (.env.mvsdev, .env.drnmig3a, ...).
# They hold MBT_MVS_USER/PASS, so they must never be committed -- and
# an untracked file also blocks `make release`, which refuses to run
# on anything git status reports.
.env.*
!.env.example
*.jcl
!tests/jcl/*.jcl
